      "caption": "A probability table must add to 1",
      "narration": "A discrete random variable lists every possible outcome with its probability. Here X can be 0, 1, or 2 with probabilities 0.2, 0.5, and 0.3. Those three probabilities must sum to exactly 1, because something has to happen.",
