      "caption": "Expectation: the balance point",
      "narration": "The expectation of X is the weighted average of its values, which is where the whole distribution would balance on a pivot. Zero times 0.2 plus 1 times 0.5 plus 2 times 0.3 gives 1.1, so the fulcrum sits at 1.1.",
